(5820084, 848217, 66384, '<td valign="top">The focus seems off on the whole image. I cant find anything that''s sharp. Did you use a tripod?</td>', 'The focus seems off on the whole image. I cant find anything that''s sharp. Did you use a tripod?', '2010-01-20 17:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5820087, 848276, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think I would like it better without the person in the shot.</td>', 'I think I would like it better without the person in the shot.', '2010-01-20 17:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5820121, 846865, 28427, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colour combination</td>', 'Beautiful colour combination', '2010-01-20 17:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5820139, 848267, 28427, '<td valign="top">I hope your camera didn''t get splashed.<br/>Since I''m giving a low score, I feel I ow you an explanation:<br/>There are several points which are distracting.  The toothbrush, the black (mould) stain on the ceiling and reflecting in the mirror, the mirror itself, the light on the right, the white I-don''t-know-what round thing on the left,...<br/>The idea is good, no doubt about it.  But the execution seems a hurry-up job.</td>', 'I hope your camera didn''t get splashed.Since I''m giving a low score, I feel I ow you an explanation:There are several points which are distracting.  The toothbrush, the black (mould) stain on the ceiling and reflecting in the mirror, the mirror itself, the light on the right, the white I-don''t-know-what round thing on the left,...The idea is good, no doubt about it.  But the execution seems a hurry-up job.', '2010-01-20 17:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5820149, 848148, 78652, '<td valign="top">I''d really love a tighter crop on this one so that you could look at the design and patterns of color on the bubbles closer up.</td>', 'I''d really love a tighter crop on this one so that you could look at the design and patterns of color on the bubbles closer up.', '2010-01-20 17:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5820150, 847898, 78652, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple, wish the bubbles and objects were a sharper.</td>', 'Nice and simple, wish the bubbles and objects were a sharper.', '2010-01-20 17:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5820151, 847326, 78652, '<td valign="top">Cute photo, one of my favorites in this challenge.  Would''ve been great to see some of the bubbles in really sharp focus also.</td>', 'Cute photo, one of my favorites in this challenge.  Would''ve been great to see some of the bubbles in really sharp focus also.', '2010-01-20 17:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5820154, 847763, 28427, '<td valign="top">A good idea but the execution could have been better, sharper.  Maybe if you had used e.g. a lamp in stead of the light falling through the window?</td>', 'A good idea but the execution could have been better, sharper.  Maybe if you had used e.g. a lamp in stead of the light falling through the window?', '2010-01-20 17:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5820155, 848221, 78652, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and I''ll probably try one like this.  I think more contrast would draw more attention to the theme''s elements.</td>', 'I like this shot and I''ll probably try one like this.  I think more contrast would draw more attention to the theme''s elements.', '2010-01-20 17:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5820158, 848184, 28427, '<td valign="top">Shame of the background and the reflection of your in-camera flash.</td>', 'Shame of the background and the reflection of your in-camera flash.', '2010-01-20 18:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5820170, 847989, 78652, '<td valign="top">The out of focus water makes up most of the image.  Looks like the sharpest element is on the lower right corner (the frozen bumpy bubbly mass).  I keep looking at the top of that bumpy mass and would love to see it up closer.  Perhaps crop and make that mass a majority of the image?</td>', 'The out of focus water makes up most of the image.  Looks like the sharpest element is on the lower right corner (the frozen bumpy bubbly mass).  I keep looking at the top of that bumpy mass and would love to see it up closer.  Perhaps crop and make that mass a majority of the image?', '2010-01-20 18:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5820185, 848061, 78652, '<td valign="top">Like the look.  More sharpness throughout the depth of the bubble would be great!</td>', 'Like the look.  More sharpness throughout the depth of the bubble would be great!', '2010-01-20 18:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5820187, 848167, 78652, '<td valign="top">Very busy and not a lot of elements to stop and focus on.</td>', 'Very busy and not a lot of elements to stop and focus on.', '2010-01-20 18:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
