(5835819, 847686, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is just too perfect, as an event/pose, not to get a 10 from me. The noise reduction has gone insane, which I think is gonna get you hammered; look close and see all those smooth wavy little artefacts? But in the end, I have decicded I LIKE them, in this case, and I''m not sure why. So I give you a 10. This is just so danged HUMAN :-)</td>', 'This is just too perfect, as an event/pose, not to get a 10 from me. The noise reduction has gone insane, which I think is gonna get you hammered; look close and see all those smooth wavy little artefacts? But in the end, I have decicded I LIKE them, in this case, and I''m not sure why. So I give you a 10. This is just so danged HUMAN :-)', '2010-01-26 22:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
