(5836084, 847311, 83313, '<td valign="top">Considering I gave this a 10, I hope you are flattered that I thought this was Barry''s entry. Please accept this humble shoehorn award, recognizing the injection of some much needed humor into a non-humorous challenge topic.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=737193" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_737193.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_737193.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_737193.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by spiritualspatula:</b></div><hr/><i> My first inclination is to think this is an entry from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yo_Spiff</a>, though I can''t say I want to know why you have a barbie (assuming I''m correct).<br/>Regardless, amusing shot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Oh, this is even better! You were mistaken for me! Wish I <u>had</u> thought of it. Yes, I <u>would</u> have naked Barbie''s around the house. I have girls. At one time my house held the largest naked Barbie collection in Texas.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-01-27 00:13:37.</i></td>', 'Considering I gave this a 10, I hope you are flattered that I thought this was Barry''s entry. Please accept this humble shoehorn award, recognizing the injection of some much needed humor into a non-humorous challenge topic.  Originally posted by spiritualspatula: My first inclination is to think this is an entry from  Yo_Spiff, though I can''t say I want to know why you have a barbie (assuming I''m correct).Regardless, amusing shot.  Oh, this is even better! You were mistaken for me! Wish I had thought of it. Yes, I would have naked Barbie''s around the house. I have girls. At one time my house held the largest naked Barbie collection in Texas.', '2010-01-27 00:10:17.000000', '2010-01-27 00:13:37.000000', 0),
(5836092, 847326, 61315, '<td valign="top">I was right! ;-) Jack is very, very cute - what breed is he?</td>', 'I was right! ;-) Jack is very, very cute - what breed is he?', '2010-01-27 00:14:06.000000', NULL, 0),
