(5837025, 847865, 113278, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cynthiann:</b></div><hr/><i> One of my favorites for this challenge.  Without the border, which I think distracts from the mood of the photo, I would have given it a 9 or 10.  I gave it a 7 regardless. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you. After looking at it more I see that the border was a bit much. I had a few choices for this challenge but there was just something I really liked about this shot.</td>', 'Originally posted by cynthiann: One of my favorites for this challenge.  Without the border, which I think distracts from the mood of the photo, I would have given it a 9 or 10.  I gave it a 7 regardless.   Thank you. After looking at it more I see that the border was a bit much. I had a few choices for this challenge but there was just something I really liked about this shot.', '2010-01-27 08:59:01.000000', NULL, 0),
