(5837164, 847311, 111167, '<td valign="top">Thank you!  I''m very grateful for the 10 and the shoehorn... and flattered for being mistaken for such esteemed photographers as you Yo and Barry, who obviously value humor as highly as I do. There are at least 16 people on this site who have absolutely no sense of humor, as they rated this a 1.  We can only pray they get healed from their malady.  :)<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> Considering I gave this a 10, I hope you are flattered that I thought this was Barry''s entry. Please accept this humble shoehorn award, recognizing the injection of some much needed humor into a non-humorous challenge topic.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=737193" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_737193.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_737193.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_737193.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by spiritualspatula:</b></div><hr/><i> My first inclination is to think this is an entry from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yo_Spiff</a>, though I can''t say I want to know why you have a barbie (assuming I''m correct).<br/>Regardless, amusing shot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Oh, this is even better! You were mistaken for me! Wish I <u>had</u> thought of it. Yes, I <u>would</u> have naked Barbie''s around the house. I have girls. At one time my house held the largest naked Barbie collection in Texas. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Thank you!  I''m very grateful for the 10 and the shoehorn... and flattered for being mistaken for such esteemed photographers as you Yo and Barry, who obviously value humor as highly as I do. There are at least 16 people on this site who have absolutely no sense of humor, as they rated this a 1.  We can only pray they get healed from their malady.  :) Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: Considering I gave this a 10, I hope you are flattered that I thought this was Barry''s entry. Please accept this humble shoehorn award, recognizing the injection of some much needed humor into a non-humorous challenge topic.  Originally posted by spiritualspatula: My first inclination is to think this is an entry from  Yo_Spiff, though I can''t say I want to know why you have a barbie (assuming I''m correct).Regardless, amusing shot.  Oh, this is even better! You were mistaken for me! Wish I had thought of it. Yes, I would have naked Barbie''s around the house. I have girls. At one time my house held the largest naked Barbie collection in Texas. ', '2010-01-27 09:35:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5837188, 847311, 111167, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments! <br/>And for moosh, who ''finds my use of a child''s toys in this way disturbing''... I just want to clarify that these are not a child''s toys... they are MY toys, and I am an adult. So you can rest easy now. <br/>:)</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments! And for moosh, who ''finds my use of a child''s toys in this way disturbing''... I just want to clarify that these are not a child''s toys... they are MY toys, and I am an adult. So you can rest easy now. :)', '2010-01-27 09:41:10.000000', NULL, 0),
