(5839036, 847311, 61315, '<td valign="top">Fun shot Sheila and I thought it was great! I gave you a 6 and thought it should have scored higher. People are sometimes just too serious around here. :-) I actually bought some Barbie and Ken dolls for myself to use in Photography as my daughter HATED dolls when she was little but I thought they would make great props some day. :-) I had forgotten about them but will have to dig them out for a challenge some time. Maybe we can start a side challenge some day for Barbie dolls. :-) Congrats on your Humor Award - you deserve it!</td>', 'Fun shot Sheila and I thought it was great! I gave you a 6 and thought it should have scored higher. People are sometimes just too serious around here. :-) I actually bought some Barbie and Ken dolls for myself to use in Photography as my daughter HATED dolls when she was little but I thought they would make great props some day. :-) I had forgotten about them but will have to dig them out for a challenge some time. Maybe we can start a side challenge some day for Barbie dolls. :-) Congrats on your Humor Award - you deserve it!', '2010-01-27 21:28:53.000000', NULL, 0),
