(5843082, 847161, 14476, '<td valign="top"><b>GREETINGS FROM THE CRITIQUE CLUB</b> <br/> <br/>Welcome to DPC.  I see this is your very first entry!  I hope it is the first of many.<br/> <br/>I really, really like the blue color you selected to show off your bubble. Placement in the frame is good and the black streaks give it some interest.  And it is a unique presentation.  <br/> <br/>Unfortunately, I''m not sure the simplicity of this was enough to keep the attention of the viewer long enough to really appreciate your approach.<br/> <br/>Keep those images coming.<br/>I look forward to seeing more of your work on DPC.<br/></td>', 'GREETINGS FROM THE CRITIQUE CLUB  Welcome to DPC.  I see this is your very first entry!  I hope it is the first of many. I really, really like the blue color you selected to show off your bubble. Placement in the frame is good and the black streaks give it some interest.  And it is a unique presentation.   Unfortunately, I''m not sure the simplicity of this was enough to keep the attention of the viewer long enough to really appreciate your approach. Keep those images coming.I look forward to seeing more of your work on DPC.', '2010-01-29 10:30:45.000000', NULL, 0),
