(5845205, 847251, 113324, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by beaflies:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice color and form but there doesn''t seem to be anything in focus.  Focus is #1 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comment, I couldn''t actually get this to focus. The container was a polythene like material, which made the bubble and everything blurry. I''ll know better next time.</td>', 'Originally posted by beaflies: Nice color and form but there doesn''t seem to be anything in focus.  Focus is #1   Thanks for the comment, I couldn''t actually get this to focus. The container was a polythene like material, which made the bubble and everything blurry. I''ll know better next time.', '2010-01-31 07:33:32.000000', NULL, 0),
