(5848135, 847569, 32641, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ertert:</b></div><hr/><i> very good!  Looks like it was just about to burst, how long did you stand there to get it at that moment ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I think it was about 5-6 minutes. The time between bursts is varying from 5-10 min.<br/>This bubble is about 2 meters wide and rises up to maybe 60 cm (2ft) before it bursts.</td>', 'Originally posted by ertert: very good!  Looks like it was just about to burst, how long did you stand there to get it at that moment ?  I think it was about 5-6 minutes. The time between bursts is varying from 5-10 min.This bubble is about 2 meters wide and rises up to maybe 60 cm (2ft) before it bursts.', '2010-02-01 18:54:46.000000', NULL, 0),
